        {
          "text": "Lino bantu bangu ba-Israyeli ndabapa busena bwakukala, njoobazitikizya mpoonya awo, kuti bakalilile kulimbabo akutatuntulika limbi, Nkabela bana ba-Saatani tabakooyoobakataazya limbi mbuli mbubakabakataazya kukusaanguna, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
