        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwi aya makani akali mbuli makani maniini buyo kumeso aako, O Mwami Jehova, nkaambo waamba aabasiŋanda bangu abakuciindi ciciza cicili kule. Sa mbuboobu mbuubede mulao wabantu, O Mwami Jehova? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
